{"ugly":[{"p":"adj","l":"形容詞","zh":"醜的、難看的","ex":[{"en":"It's not the person that's ugly, but the clothes.","zh":"難看的不是人，而是衣服。","s":"t","id":891822,"by":"FeuDRenais2","zid":891831,"zby":"FeuDRenais","rev":1,"sp":[27,31]},{"en":"An ugly man knocked on my door.","zh":"一個長得很醜的男人敲了我的門。","s":"t","id":73119,"by":"CK","zid":333234,"zby":"fucongcong","rev":1,"sp":[3,7]},{"en":"That building is really ugly.","zh":"那棟建築真的很醜。","s":"ai","sp":[24,28]}]},{"p":"adj","l":"形容詞","zh":"令人不快的、險惡的","ex":[{"en":"This water has an ugly smell.","zh":"這水有一股難聞的味道。","s":"t","id":58291,"by":"","zid":2295633,"zby":"zhangtai","rev":1,"sp":[18,22]},{"en":"The argument turned ugly.","zh":"那場爭吵變得很難看。","s":"ai","sp":[20,24]}]}]}